WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Admin → Companies with company-management authority and choose Add company.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Create its first location and rename company details as needed.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
